   "ja": "鉅鹿の戦い。項羽は渡河すると船を沈め、釜を壊し、三日分の食糧だけを持たせて退路を断ち (破釜沈舟)、王離の秦軍を九度戦って破った。諸侯の将は膝で進んで項羽の陣に入り、顔を上げられなかったという。",
   "en": "The battle of Julu. Once across the river Xiang Yu sank the boats and broke the cooking pots, leaving three days' food and no way back; he fought Wang Li's Qin army nine times and broke it. The other lords' generals came into his camp on their knees, it is said, and dared not look up."
