   "en": "Zhao Gao presented a deer to the Second Emperor and called it a horse, and ruined those who said \"deer\". Soon he forced the emperor to kill himself in the Wangyi palace and set up Ziying, who gave up the imperial title for \"King of Qin\" — and had Zhao Gao put to death."
