   "ja": "武関から関中に入った{r_liu}に、秦王子嬰は首に紐をかけ、白馬の車で迎えて降った。劉邦は宝物に手をつけず、秦の苛法を廃して「法三章」だけを約し、民の心をつかんだ。",
   "en": "{r_liu} came into the land within the passes by the Wu pass; Ziying, King of Qin, met him in a white-horse carriage with a cord round his neck and surrendered. Liu Bang left the treasures alone, abolished the harsh Qin laws, and promised just three — and won the people."
