   "at": "hongmen",
   "ja": "鴻門の会。関中を先に取られて怒る項羽のもとへ、劉邦は自ら謝罪に赴いた。范増は項荘に剣舞をさせて劉邦を討たせようとしたが、項伯が共に舞って庇い、樊噲が盾を持って乱入した。劉邦は厠に立つふりをして逃れた。范増は「豎子ともに謀るに足らず」と玉斗を砕いた。",
   "en": "The feast at Hongmen. Liu Bang came in person to apologise to Xiang Yu, furious that Liu had reached the passes first. Fan Zeng had Xiang Zhuang perform a sword dance to kill him; Xiang Bo danced too and shielded him, and Fan Kuai burst in with his shield. Liu Bang slipped away as if to the privy. \"The boy is not worth plotting with,\" Fan Zeng said, and smashed his jade cup."
