   "at": "pengcheng",
   "ja": "項羽は自ら西楚覇王と称して彭城を都とし、諸侯の将を十八の王に封じた。劉邦は約束の関中ではなく、辺地の巴・蜀・漢中の漢王とされた。関中は秦の降将章邯・司馬欣・董翳の三人に分けられた。",
   "en": "Xiang Yu took the title Hegemon-King of Western Chu with Pengcheng as his capital, and made the lords' generals kings of eighteen realms. Liu Bang was given not the land within the passes he had been promised, but the remote Ba, Shu and Hanzhong as King of Han; the land within the passes went to three surrendered Qin generals, Zhang Han, Sima Xin and Dong Yi."
