   "at": "pengcheng",
   "ja": "彭城の戦い。五十六万の諸侯の軍を率いた{r_liu}は、項羽の留守の彭城を落として連日酒宴を開いた。斉から三万の精兵で取って返した項羽は、一朝にして漢軍を破り、睢水は屍で流れが止まったという。劉邦は父と妻を捕らえられ、わずかな供と逃れた。",
   "en": "The battle of Pengcheng. Leading five hundred and sixty thousand men of the lords, {r_liu} took Pengcheng while Xiang Yu was away and feasted for days. Xiang Yu came back from Qi with thirty thousand picked men and broke the Han army in a morning; the Sui river, they say, was dammed with bodies. Liu Bang's father and wife were taken, and he fled with a handful of men."
