   "ja": "井陘の戦い。韓信は川を背に陣を敷き (背水の陣)、退けない兵を死に物狂いで戦わせる間に、別働隊に趙の城の旗を漢の赤旗に変えさせた。趙軍は総崩れとなり、陳余は討たれ、趙王歇は捕らえられた。",
   "en": "The battle of Jingxing. Han Xin drew up with a river at his back, so his men could not retreat and fought like the desperate, while a detachment swapped the flags on the Zhao fortress for the red flags of Han. The Zhao army fell apart; Chen Yu was killed and Zhao Xie, King of Zhao, captured."
