   "en": "The battle of the Wei river. Han Xin attacked Qi, and when Long Ju came from Chu to save it, he split Long Ju's army by releasing the dammed waters of the Wei, and killed him. Li Yiji, who had already talked Qi into peace, had been boiled alive by the King of Qi when Han Xin attacked."
