   "en": "Han Xin asked to be acting King of Qi. As Liu Bang began to rage, Zhang Liang and Chen Ping trod on his foot, and he went on: \"A real man should be a real king, not an acting one,\" and made him King of Qi. Kuai Tong urged Han Xin to divide the realm in three; remembering Liu Bang's kindness, Han Xin refused."
